  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Food Systems 2030 Multi-Donor Trust Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Food Systems 2030 (FS2030). Scaling up Action for Transformative Change. World Bank Umbrella Programme anchored in a Multi-Donor Trust Fund. FS2030 helps countries rethink and transform their food systems from farm to fork, taking into account climate and environmental aspects while delivering improved livelihoods and affordable, sustainable, nutritious diets for all.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The FS2030 Development Objective, as defined by the World Bank, is to contribute to the UN Sustainable Development Goals and the Paris Agreement by helping countries build better food systems for healthy people, a healthy planet and healthy economy.</narrative>
  </description>
